  "description": "Seo Gi-Un and Yeo U-Il started working together on a site specializing in adult products. In one of their recent reviews, there was a malicious comment that said: \"The product reviews aren't made by a couple, so there is no credibility in them.\" \n\nAngrily, U-Il says, \"Do I need to have a one-night stand to write a review?\" To what Gi-Un replied without hesitation: \"Let's do it\". U-Il then panics, he is worried about whether their good relationship will take a blow after this, but it's a waste to leave a handsome face and body behind... \n\n*Note: The chapter count includes 5 special stories. *\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)**",
